min : ∀ t &lt; T, x (t + <span class=\"num\">1</span>) ∈ V ∧ IsMinOn (<span class=\"kw\">fun</span> z =&gt; loss t z + ((‖z - x t‖ ^ <span class=\"num\">2</span> / (<span class=\"num\">2</span> * η t) : ℝ) : EReal)) V (x (t + <span class=\"num\">1</span>))) (u : E) (hu : u ∈ V) : (∀ t ≤ T, iterate V (<span class=\"kw\">fun</span> z : E =&gt; ‖z‖ ^ <span class=\"num\">2</span> / <span class=\"num\">2</span>) η loss x0 t = some (x t)) ∧ (∑ t ∈ range T, ((loss t (x (t + <span class=\"num\">1</span>))).toReal - (loss t u).toReal)) ≤ ((range T).sup&#x27; (nonempty_range_iff.mpr (Nat.ne_of_gt hT)) (<span class=\"kw\">fun</span> t =&gt; ‖u - x t‖ ^ <span class=\"num\">2</span> / <span class=\"num\">2</span>)) / η (T - <span class=\"num\">1</span>) - ∑ t ∈ range T, ‖x (t + <span class=\"num\">1</span>) - x t‖ ^ <span class=\"num\">2</span> / (<span class=\"num\">2</span> * η t)</code></pre>\n+    <div class=\"source-links\">\n+      <a href=\"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/3b393adb009bc25a2c6e3fa3148bf9a3a2b4c376/BanditRLProof/OnlinePrescientEuclidean.lean#L41\">Source line 41</a>\n+      <a href=\"../../chapters/online-ogd/index.html#decl-c42a5c2e28ad-teaching\">Open teaching explanation</a>\n+      <a href=\"../../chapters/online-ogd/index.html\">Chapter context: Projected OGD</a>\n+    </div>\n+  </div>\n+</details>\n+<details class=\"declaration\" id=\"decl-ba3ebca3a76e\">\n+  <summary>\n+    <span class=\"kind\">theorem</span>\n+    <code>BanditRL.OnlinePrescientBregman.euclidean_fixed_regret</code>\n+    <span><span class=\"status compiled\">Compiled</span> </span>\n+  </summary>\n+  <div class=\"declaration-content\">\n+    <p class=\"empty\">No declaration docstring is present; use the chapter context and exact statement below.</p>\n+    <div class=\"node-memberships\"><p><strong>Used in these reading views:</strong> <a href=\"../../books/online-learning/index.html\">Online Learning Book</a></p>\n+<p><a href=\"../../chapters/online-ogd/