lt; T, x (t + <span class=\"num\">1</span>) ∈ V ∧ IsMinOn (<span class=\"kw\">fun</span> z =&gt; loss t z + ((‖z - x t‖ ^ <span class=\"num\">2</span> / (<span class=\"num\">2</span> * η) : ℝ) : EReal)) V (x (t + <span class=\"num\">1</span>))) (u : E) (hu : u ∈ V) : (∀ t ≤ T, iterate V (<span class=\"kw\">fun</span> z : E =&gt; ‖z‖ ^ <span class=\"num\">2</span> / <span class=\"num\">2</span>) (<span class=\"kw\">fun</span> _ =&gt; η) loss x0 t = some (x t)) ∧ (∑ t ∈ range T, ((loss t (x (t + <span class=\"num\">1</span>))).toReal - (loss t u).toReal)) ≤ ‖u - x0‖ ^ <span class=\"num\">2</span> / (<span class=\"num\">2</span> * η) - (∑ t ∈ range T, ‖x (t + <span class=\"num\">1</span>) - x t‖ ^ <span class=\"num\">2</span>) / (<span class=\"num\">2</span> * η)</code></pre>\n+    <div class=\"source-links\">\n+      <a href=\"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/3b393adb009bc25a2c6e3fa3148bf9a3a2b4c376/BanditRLProof/OnlinePrescientEuclidean.lean#L102\">Source line 102</a>\n+      <a href=\"../../chapters/online-ogd/index.html#decl-ba3ebca3a76e-teaching\">Open teaching explanation</a>\n+      <a href=\"../../chapters/online-ogd/index.html\">Chapter context: Projected OGD</a>\n+    </div>\n+  </div>\n+</details></div>\n+</section>\n+</main>\n+      <aside class=\"side-nav\" data-page-toc aria-label=\"On this page\"><button class=\"side-nav-toggle\" type=\"button\" data-toc-toggle aria-controls=\"page-toc-links\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"side-nav-toggle-label\">On this page</span><span class=\"side-nav-current\" data-toc-current>Module</span><span class=\"side-nav-chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⌄</span></button><strong class=\"side-nav-label\">On this page</strong><nav class=\"side-nav-links\" id=\"page-toc-links\"><a data-toc-link href=\"#module\">Module</a><a data-toc-link href=\"#metadata\">Module map</a><a data-toc-link href=\"#declarations\">Declarations</a></nav></aside>\n+    </div>\n+    <footer class=\"site-footer\">\n+     